        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"model\": \"gpt-4.1-mini\",\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\n      \"role\": \"user\",\n      \"content\": \"Analyze the GitHub repository based on the provided data.\\n\\nRepository name:\\n{{ $json['items.full_name'] }}\\n\\nDescription:\\n{{ $json['items.description'] }}\\n\\nPrimary language:\\n{{ $json['items.language'] }}\\n\\nStars:\\n{{ $json['items.stargazers_count'] }}\\n\\nLast updated:\\n{{ $json['items.updated_at'] }}\\n\\nTopics:\\n{{ $json['items.topics'] }}\\n\\nRepository URL:\\n{{ $json['items.html_url'] }}\\n\\nYour task is to briefly determine the purpose of the project, its likely operating principle, and its practical value based only on the available data.\\n\\nIMPORTANT RULES:\\n- Use only information that can be supported by the provided data.\\n- Do not invent technologies, architecture, features, requirements, or implementation details that are not present in the data.\\n- Do not present assumptions as confirmed facts.\\n- If an accurate conclusion cannot be made, write: \"Not determined from the available data.\"\\n- Do not summarize or rewrite the README.\\n- Do not evaluate code quality because the source code has not been provided.\\n- Do not use marketing language.\\n- Do not call the project innovative unless there is sufficient evidence in the provided data.\\n- Keep the answer concise, structured, neutral, and informative.\\n\\nAnswer STRICTLY in the following format.\\n\\n====================\\n\\nName:\\nProvide the project name.\\n\\nCategory:\\nChoose the most appropriate project category, for example: IoT, Embedded, AI, Web, Mobile, Automation, Developer Tools, Library, Framework, or another suitable category.\\n\\nWhat it does:\\nMaximum 2–3 sentences. Briefly explain the main purpose of the project.\\n\\nHow it works:\\nMaximum 3 sentences. Describe the operating principle only based on the available data. If it cannot be determined, write: \"Not determined from the available data.\"\\n\\nRequirements:\\nList only technologies, platforms, devices, programming languages, or other requirements that are explicitly supported by the provided data. If there is not enough information, write: \"Not determined from the available data.\"\\n\\nWhy it is interesting:\\nDescribe the practical value and notable characteristics of the project only based on the available data.\\n•\\n•\\n•\\n\\nConfidence level:\\nHigh / Medium / Low\\n\\n====================\\n\\nAdditional rules:\\n- Do not add any text before or after the specified format.\\n- Do not repeat the input data unnecessarily.\\n- Do not invent missing technical details.\\n- If the information is contradictory or insufficient, state this explicitly.\\n- Use neutral, technical language.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"temperature\": 0.2,\n  \"max_tokens\": 700\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
